            <div purpose="feature-row">
              <div purpose="feature-item">
                <div purpose="feature-headline">
                  <img alt="Lock" purpose="feature-icon" src="/images/icon-lock-20x20@2x.png">
                  <h5>Security is sold separately</h5>
                </div>
                <div purpose="feature-text">
                  <p>Workspace ONE hands security and compliance to partners. Vulnerability management covers Windows only, through Workspace ONE Intelligence. Everything else is another contract.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div purpose="feature-item">
                <div purpose="feature-headline">
                  <img alt="Devices" purpose="feature-icon" src="/images/icon-enrolled-device-36x36@2x.png">
                  <h5>Linux is left out</h5>
